OL,3,GNEWSAPublic asked to have their say on
OL,4,Aproposed new renewable energy company
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople across the country are being
OL,7,Fasked to have their say on proposals
OL,8,Ffor a new renewable energy company
OL,9,Fowned by the Welsh government.
OL,11,FIt would "develop and own" wind and
OL,12,Fsolar plants, and support local
OL,13,Fcommunities to take an ownership stake.
OL,15,FThe Plaid Cymru-led Welsh government
OL,16,Fhope it can reduce the cost of bills in
OL,17,Fthe long term, but the company would
OL,18,Fnot directly set energy prices.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
