OL,3,GNEWSAPublic asked to have their say on
OL,4,Aproposed new renewable energy company
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt does not set out to replace the
OL,7,Forganisations that provide energy
OL,8,Fdirect to customers, with the
OL,9,Fgovernment inviting people for views on
OL,10,Fhow it should operate.
